 # 11\. Booking Management

 Customers shall be able to:

 1. Select a venue.
2. Select a turf.
3. Select a date.
4. Select a time.
5. Review booking information.
6. Initiate payment.
7. Receive confirmation after successful payment.

 The system shall prevent overlapping bookings.

 ## 11.1 Booking States

```
PENDING
HELD
PAYMENT_PENDING
CONFIRMED
CANCELLED
EXPIRED
COMPLETED
REFUND_PENDING
REFUNDED
```

 ## 11.2 Temporary Holds

 When a customer begins the booking/payment process, the selected slot may be temporarily held.

 Example:

```
AVAILABLE
    ↓
HELD
    ↓
PAYMENT_PENDING
    ↓
CONFIRMED
```

 If payment is not completed within the configured period:

```
HELD
  ↓
EXPIRED
  ↓
AVAILABLE
```

 The database shall enforce booking integrity to prevent concurrent customers from successfully reserving the same inventory.

